        "## Load the model and the helpers (written for you)\n",
        "\n",
        "We use **Stable Diffusion v1.5**, a small, fast model that runs on the free Colab GPU and supports text-to-image, img2img, and inpainting.\n",
        "\n",
        "The cell below loads the pipeline once and reuses its weights for every part, so it stays in memory."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 23,
      "id": "3cfb3402",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 67,
          "referenced_widgets": [
            "b1c12821855f455aa87b2a67352acc02",
            "e219638986894eae8844bd04e0c82d79",
            "48698b99c64548b0bcdc14b78f674b70",
            "163361e4c346459f8a499aeadc18f37f",
            "4e6430e519f04bb9b3f158f206530331",
            "9777c11826e4465c9e24609df08d44b6",
            "2b9a7cfc254c4d2b94b5ec50d53f9b31",
            "a29c572dec3c408e95afc601f6fe90ab",
            "03745beef548477189bafebc8d54b46b",
            "2af39f8287f9455baee530e2f04edc6c",
            "96d37ea7d02647bebb1f79cf1a4355b4"
          ]
        },
        "id": "3cfb3402",
        "outputId": "7f01c9c4-cd14-418c-c28e-5a80ec84a451"
