        "## Part A1 — Guidance sweep\n",
        "\n",
        "Generate three images with **guidance scale = 3, 7, 12**.\n",
        "Keep **steps fixed at 30** and use your **signature seed** for all three.\n",
        "\n",
        "Guidance scale controls how hard the model is pushed to match the prompt. Watch what changes\n",
        "between loose (3) and tight (12)."
      ]
