      "source": [
        "## Part C — Trigger one failure mode\n",
        "\n",
        "Pick **one** known weakness and deliberately make the model fail at it:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Counting** — ask for an exact number of objects (e.g. \"exactly seven apples\").\n",
        "- **Hands** — ask for a clear close-up of hands.\n",
        "- **Identities** — ask for a specific real, named person (note: the model may refuse or distort).\n",
        "- **Diagrams** — ask for a labeled technical diagram with correct text.\n",
        "\n",
        "Generate the image, save it, then **explain in plain English why it failed** in your report (Part D).\n",
        "Use your signature seed so the failure is reproducible."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 41,
      "id": "7cc90e7d",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1134
        },
        "id": "7cc90e7d",
        "outputId": "e5c69d49-ea21-44d4-9f84-c791e0e1bb62"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<PIL.Image.Image image mode=RGB size=512x550>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n",
            "image/jpeg": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
