      "source": [
        "## Part D — Process log and reflection\n",
        "\n",
        "**This part is written in your report, not in the notebook.** The notebook just needs to show all\n",
        "your images. In your report include:\n",
        "\n",
        "- A **process log**: three or more versions of a prompt you iterated on, and what changed each time.\n",
        "- A **250–350 word reflection**. Every claim must cite a figure by number (e.g. \"In Figure A1-c,\n",
        "  guidance 12 over-saturated the colors...\").\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### Before you export\n",
        "1. **Run all cells top to bottom** so every output is visible. Do **not** clear outputs.\n",
        "2. Confirm your sweep, edit, and failure-mode images all appear.\n",
        "3. Export: **File → Print → Save as PDF**.\n",
        "\n",
        "### File naming (underscores only, your real HCC enrollment name)\n",
        "```\n",
        "L07_LastName_FirstName_ITAI1378_notebook.pdf\n",
        "L07_LastName_FirstName_ITAI1378_report.pdf\n",
        "```\n",
        "Submit **both PDFs** in Canvas before the syllabus due date."
      ]
    },
